{"5070180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Color", "steam_appid": 5070180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070180/extras/0f09cb12a7858d4ecb265313f39c97a2.avif?t=1787848530\" width=1536 height=1114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Color</strong> is a multiplayer survival game where you and other players face an ever-growing army of colors. Every wave introduces a new enemy color, while your progress brings larger hordes and new, more dangerous enemy types. The objective is simple, yet almost impossible: reach the final color on wave <strong>16,777,216</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070180/extras/e8c16faaf270411885b847eef06f85f5.poster.avif?t=1787848530\" width=800 height=580 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070180/extras/e8c16faaf270411885b847eef06f85f5.webm?t=1787848530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070180/extras/e8c16faaf270411885b847eef06f85f5.mp4?t=1787848530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070180/extras/6b1475b4adb7e34cb41551e7b9a9a35e.avif?t=1787848530\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins to increase your team’s shared level. Whenever you level up, choose one of three upgrade cards to unlock new weapons, strengthen passive abilities, or gain active skills. Combine upgrades, cooperate with your team, and survive the chaos that intensifies with every new color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070180/extras/930ff80bb05a6772baca886bd332bc97.poster.avif?t=1787848530\" width=800 height=580 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070180/extras/930ff80bb05a6772baca886bd332bc97.webm?t=1787848530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070180/extras/930ff80bb05a6772baca886bd332bc97.mp4?t=1787848530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070180/extras/0f09cb12a7858d4ecb265313f39c97a2.avif?t=1787848530\" width=1536 height=1114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Color</strong> is a multiplayer survival game where you and other players face an ever-growing army of colors. Every wave introduces a new enemy color, while your progress brings larger hordes and new, more dangerous enemy types. The objective is simple, yet almost impossible: reach the final color on wave <strong>16,777,216</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070180/extras/e8c16faaf270411885b847eef06f85f5.poster.avif?t=1787848530\" width=800 height=580 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070180/extras/e8c16faaf270411885b847eef06f85f5.webm?t=1787848530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"h